# Build context for the signaling server.
#
# The image copies four things: the two package.json files, shared/ and
# packages/server/. Everything else here is context the daemon packs and
# transfers for nothing — and the agent's release builds and node_modules
# together are most of a gigabyte, on a VPS, on every build.
#
# The agent is a desktop app and is deliberately not built in Docker, so
# its whole workspace is excluded rather than trimmed.

node_modules/
**/node_modules/
packages/host/

# Device registry of a locally running server. The deployed one keeps
# its own in a volume; copying a developer's in would hand the server
# someone else's registrations.
data/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git/
.gitignore
tests/
scripts/
infra/
*.log
.DS_Store
